\">antechambers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Muggy%20Plains\">Muggy Plains</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Corruption%20Hole\">Corruption Hole</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Razachai\">Razachai</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Temple%20of%20Equilibrium\">Temple of Equilibrium</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Northern%20Zao%20Plantations\">Northern Zao Plantations</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tKeeps its distance while shooting fire missiles. Runs in low health.<br/><br/>A lizard dragon priest attacks from a distance.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tKill it as soon as you can, since it can be annoying as it summons up to 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Hatchling\">Dragon Hatchlings</a> and heals fairly quick.<br/>\nMages: Shoot an <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Bomb\">Energy Bomb</a> on it. It won't leave the fields (provided it is in the center). Position yourself in front of it and attack it with Spells, Runes and your Wand or Rod.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 57,169 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=\"3